      FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
      "3bdf197f-a98c-4987-89ab-cd9ab9b0c63e"],
     " for the initial condition ",
     Cell[BoxData[
      StyleBox["in", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
      FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
      "18cfb2ba-238f-4ed0-87bf-71249e1983b4"],
     ", and returns the single-particle Green's function matrices at times \
